config LOG
	bool "log: loggers, log sinks, and printf-style call sites"
	default y
	select STATUS
	select IO
	select FMT
	select TIME
	help
	  Logging for applications: a logger with a level, a tag, and a clock;
	  the el_log_sink interface that decides where records go; a sink
	  that writes text lines to an el_writer, and one that keeps records
	  in caller-provided memory; and the contract test suite for sinks.
	  Elemental's own modules never log.
